Adaptations: route only explicitly global scheduler requests through the existing
SAFE bridge; keep region/entity scheduling native; share the bridge's per-plugin
indexes, exception classification and quarantine; notify the ScheduledTask adapter
of bridge cancellation; use native global backend entry points to avoid recursion;
close admission before plugin-disable callbacks and restore Bukkit task cleanup.

